cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "Analysis code for: A hypoxia-associated SPP1+ macrophage state marks the transition from precursor lesions to invasive lung adenocarcinoma"
abstract: >-
  Analysis scripts, pre-specified and hash-locked analysis plans, and figure
  source data for a public-data study of the precursor-to-invasive transition in
  lung adenocarcinoma. No new data were generated.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-14"
repository-code: "https://github.com/xuhao1002/ggn-spp1-code"
keywords:
  - lung adenocarcinoma
  - precursor lesions
  - SPP1
  - tumour-associated macrophages
  - hypoxia
  - spatial transcriptomics
  - reproducibility
